OL,3,GNEWSAAirTag hidden in historic wall
OL,4,Areveals stone thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FA thief who was stealing a 300-year-old
OL,7,Fwall piece by piece was caught when a
OL,8,Fman put a tracking device in one of the
OL,9,Fstones.
OL,11,FMatt Smith said people living near
OL,12,FRufford Old Hall in Lancashire "were
OL,13,Fgetting a bit miffed" with stones being
OL,14,Ftaken from the historic boundary wall.
OL,16,FTo investigate, he put an Apple AirTag
OL,17,F- a coin-sized tracking device people
OL,18,Fattach to keys or wallets in case they
OL,19,Flose them - inside one of the stones.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
