OL,4,Areveals stone thief
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tracker led police to an address in
OL,7,FWigan and eventually saw a man plead
OL,8,Fguilty to two counts of theft and one
OL,9,Fcount of handling stolen goods at Wigan
OL,10,FMagistrates' Court in October.
